            "**1** Last month my toaster stopped working. A neighbour who repairs appliances as a hobby took it apart on her kitchen table, found a loose wire, and had it working again in ten minutes. The shop where I bought it had told me it was not worth repairing and offered me a discount on a new one.\n\n"
